:: \ Go to the front desk {"position":"1200,750","size":"100,100"}
Walk into the lobby, talk to the receptionist at the front desk about the delivery.
Have a nice conversation with her, and she passed me the delivery bag.

[[Link to passage J -> Take the delivery bag]]


:: \ Take the Delivery from him {"position":"1425,450","size":"100,100"}
Take the yogurt smoothie bag, and complement his outfit.

Option C

[[Walk through apartment building]]


:: \ Take the delivery bag {"position":"1425,750","size":"100,100"}
Go to the front desk, talk to the receptionist about the starbuck delivery.
She's really busy, and she said she didn't know about the delivery. She asked me to wait 
outside the lobby.

Walked outside the lobby, saw the delivery boy arriving just in time.
Took the delivery from him and heading back.


[[Walk through apartment building]]


:: \ Taking selfies {"position":"1425,600","size":"100,100"}
Take some selfies by the phone for half an hour. The delivery guy texted me that he left the smoothie with the front desk.

[[Walk through apartment building]]


:: \ Talk to the Delivery Dude {"position":"1200,450","size":"100,100"}
Arrived at the front door earlier, saw the delivery boy on his fancy bike and wearing a funky silver and blue leather jacket, with a fake musle suit underneath. 

[[Link to passage J -> Take the Delivery from him]]


:: \ Walk down to the beach {"position":"1200,600","size":"100,100"}
Walk down to the beach to catch a late view of the sunrise.

[[Link to passage J -> Taking selfies]]


:: Feed the lizard {"position":"800,450","size":"100,100"}
Slowly approach the lizard and feed the lizard with a banana. It enjoys the banana very well. I forgot about the delivery.


[[Take the Golf Cart]]


