:: Got Scared, and Run Away {"position":"500,750","size":"100,100"}
Spooked by the huge size lizard, and running through the garden. 
Arrived at the entertrance gate, just saw the delivery boy arriving.

[[Took the delivery and head back.]]


:: Keep walking {"position":"500,600","size":"100,100"}
Walking through the garden towards the entrance gate. Enjoyed the palm trees and tropical plants along the pathway. Hearing birds chirping in the moring in the sunny weather.

[[Reach the Front Entrance, Enter the Lobby.]]


:: Lost in the hallway, can't find way to main entrance. {"position":"2200,600","size":"100,100"}
After walking throught the hallway, making turns, ended up getting lost to a dead end.
Give roomate a call to get help on directions. Manage to get help on directions and walked down to the beach. Enjoy a fantastic view of the sunrise by walking along the beach towards the entrance.

