:: Morning Delivery Pickup {"position":"100,600","size":"100,100"}
Jam just woke up in the morning, and she ordered somethinig, so the mission is to pickup Starbuck delivery of a cup of pineapple yogurt smoothie.




[[Option A ->Go to backyard]]






:: Ran into a Lizard {"position":"500,450","size":"100,100"}
Ran into a Lizard doing sunbathing. It's a huge one, but stay on the stone in the sun, very still and calm. 

[[Feed the lizard]]


